Omission
- [N1] Within matched traces (2->1) omitted: i10:Once the materials are received from the supplier

Addition
- [N2] Within matched traces (0->2) added: action(n2,"Production Order Received?")

Permutation
- [N3] Within matched traces (1->0) reordered: expected [i4:if a production order is received] but observed [action(n2,"Production Order Received?")] elsewhere; in its place the model has [action(n3,"Continue with Production Order")]
- [N4] Within matched traces (2->1) reordered: expected [i4:if a production order is received] but observed [action(n2,"Production Order Received?")] elsewhere; in its place the model has [action(n3,"Continue with Production Order")]